It makes all the code after background-image unusable. Just ran into this, quite surprising.

```css
 .ais-search-box--powered-by-link{background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg></svg>');vertical-align:middle;}
```

is converted to:

```css
 .ais-search-box--powered-by-link {
    background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;
    utf8, <svg></svg>');
    vertical-align: middle;
}
```

https://mrcoles.com/blog/css-unminify/
if it is re-minified:

```css
 .ais-search-box--powered-by-link{image:url('data:image/svg+xml;
utf8,<svg></svg>');vertical-align:middle;}
```

Cf. https://github.com/mrcoles/cssunminifier/issues/2

